xUXFTTVJIcnlnLVJQTi1KU21SWHVFT0t4Rmp3QnM0VzlEbWNTNm1SUlVNdlRQQmJxMXg0UzRIanlpZFBBSEVSNE1sMjMzNkRrU0FmUGtESEtjYVJ1SWNUaGtoTkFfbHItcXFfb3J5RjdSZi1xc2hLREhQQmVjUWs4azZQSHVMRDMxNU9fSDQ5SW5J?oc=5","date":"2026-10-09","zh":"Jim Cramer 談 TJX 公司（NYSE：TJX）：我買了它，但不想炒作我的立場"}],"themes":[{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1},{"name":"減重藥/生技","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-31","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/109198/000010919826000008/tjx-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The TJX Companies, Inc. (together with its subsidiaries, \"TJX,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" or \"our\") is the leading off-price apparel and home fashions retailer in the United States and worldwide. We have over 5,200 stores and six branded e-commerce sites that offer a rapidly changing assortment of quality, fashionable, brand name and designer merchandise at prices generally 20% to 60% below full-price retailers' (including department, specialty, and major online retailers) regular prices on comparable merchandise, every day.","zh":"TJX Companies, Inc.（連同其子公司，「TJX」、「公司」、「我們」或「我們的」）是美國和全球領先的折扣服裝和家居時尚零售商。我們擁有 5,200 多家商店和 6 個品牌電子商務網站，每天提供種類繁多的優質、時尚、品牌和設計師商品，價格通常比全價零售商（包括百貨、專賣店和主要在線零售商）正常價格低 20% 至 60%。"},{"en":"Our mission is to deliver great value to our customers every day. In our stores and online, we offer consumers our value proposition of brand, fashion, price and quality. Our opportunistic buying strategies and flexible business model differentiate us from traditional retailers. We offer a treasure hunt shopping experience and a rapid turn of inventories relative to traditional retailers. Our goal is to create a sense of excitement and urgency for our customers and encourage frequent customer visits. We acquire merchandise in a variety of ways to support that goal. We reach a broad range of customers across income levels with our value proposition on a wide range of items. Our strategies and operations are synergistic across our retail chains. As a result, we are able to leverage our expertise throughout our business, sharing information, best practices, initiatives and new ideas, and to","zh":"我們的使命是每天為客戶提供巨大的價值。在我們的商店和網路上，我們向消費者提供品牌、時尚、價格和品質的價值主張。我們的機會主義購買策略和靈活的商業模式使我們有別於傳統零售商。相對於傳統零售商，我們提供尋寶購物體驗和快速庫存週轉。我們的目標是為客戶創造一種興奮和緊迫感，並鼓勵客戶頻繁拜訪。我們透過多種方式獲取商品來支持這一目標。我們透過對各種產品的價值主張吸引了各種收入水平的廣泛客戶。我們的策略和營運在整個零售連鎖店中具有協同作用。因此，我們能夠在整個業務中利用我們的專業知識，分享資訊、最佳實踐、舉措和新想法，並"},{"en":"In this report, fiscal 2026 means the 52-week fiscal year ended January 31, 2026; fiscal 2025 means the 52-week fiscal year ended February 1, 2025 and fiscal 2024 means the 53-week fiscal year ended February 3, 2024. Fiscal 2027 means the 52-week fiscal year ending January 30, 2027. Unless otherwise indicated, all store information in this Item 1 is as of January 31, 2026, and references to store square footage are to gross square feet.","zh":"在本報告中，2026財年是指截至2026年1月31日的為期52週的財年； 2025 財年是指截至 2025 年 2 月 1 日的為期 52 週的財年，2024 財年是指截至 2024 年 2 月 3 日的財年，2024 財年是指截至 2024 年 2 月 3 日的 53 週的 53 週。 2027 財政年度是指截至 2027 年 1 月 30 日的為期 52 週的財政年度。除非另有說明，本第 1 項的所有商店資訊均截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，所提及的商店面積均指總面積腳。"}],"markets":[{"en":"We operate our business in four segments: Marmaxx and HomeGoods, both in the U.S., TJX Canada and TJX International, including Europe and Australia. In addition to our four segments, we operate the Sierra business. The results of Sierra are included with the Marmaxx segment.","zh":"我們的業務分為四個部分：Marmaxx 和 HomeGoods（均位於美國）、TJX 加拿大和 TJX 國際（包括歐洲和澳洲）。除了我們的四個部門外，我們還經營 Sierra 業務。 Sierra 的結果包含在 Marmaxx 部分。"},{"en":"Our TJ Maxx and Marshalls chains in the United States (\"Marmaxx\") are collectively the largest off-price retailer in the United States with a total of 2,603 stores. We founded TJ Maxx in 1976 and acquired Marshalls in 1995. Both chains sell family apparel (including footwear), accessories (including beauty and jewelry), home fashions (including home basics, decorative accessories and giftware), and other merchandise. We primarily differentiate TJ Maxx and Marshalls through different product assortment, including an expanded assortment of jewelry and accessories and a high-end designer department called The Runway at TJ Maxx and a full line of footwear and a broader men's offering at Marshalls, as well as varying in-store initiatives. This differentiated shopping experience at TJ Maxx and Marshalls encourages our customers to shop both chains. Marmaxx currently operates two e-commerce sit","zh":"我們在美國的 TJ Maxx 和 Marshalls 連鎖店（「Marmaxx」）是美國最大的折扣零售商，共有 2,603 家商店。我們於 1976 年創立了 TJ Maxx，並於 1995 年收購了 Marshalls。這兩家連鎖店都銷售家庭服裝（包括鞋類）、配件（包括美容和珠寶）、家居時尚（包括家居基本用品、裝飾配件和禮品）以及其他商品。我們主要透過不同的產品種類來區分 TJ Maxx 和 Marshalls，包括種類豐富的珠寶和配件、TJ Maxx 的名為 The Runway 的高端設計師部門、Marshalls 的全系列鞋類和更廣泛的男裝產品，以及不同的店內活動。 TJ Maxx 和 Marshalls 的這種差異化購物體驗鼓勵我們的顧客在這兩家連鎖店購物。 Marmaxx 目前經營兩個電子商務網站"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our mission is to deliver great value to our customers every day. We do this by offering quality, fashionable, brand name and designer merchandise in our stores with retail prices that are generally 20% to 60% below full-price retailers' (including department, specialty, and major online retailers) regular prices on comparable merchandise, every day. Our practice is to not engage in promotional pricing activity such as sales or coupons. We have generally been able to react to price fluctuations in the wholesale market to maintain our pricing gap relative to prices offered by traditional retailers as well as our merchandise margins through various economic cycles.","zh":"我們的使命是每天為客戶提供巨大的價值。為此，我們每天在商店中提供優質、時尚、品牌和設計師商品，其零售價通常比全價零售商（包括百貨、專賣店和主要線上零售商）同類商品的正常價格低 20% 至 60%。我們的做法是不參與促銷定價活動，例如銷售或優惠券。我們通常能夠對批發市場的價格波動做出反應，以維持我們相對於傳統零售商提供的價格的價格差距以及我們在不同經濟週期中的商品利潤。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The retail apparel and home fashion business is highly competitive. We compete on numerous factors including brand, fashion, price, quality, selection and freshness; in-store and online shopping experience and service; reputation and store location. We compete with local, regional, national and international department, specialty, off-price, discount, warehouse and outlet stores as well as other retailers that sell apparel, home fashions and other merchandise that we sell, whether in stores, online, or through other media or channels.","zh":"零售服飾和家居時尚業務競爭激烈。我們在品牌、時尚、價格、品質、選擇和新鮮度等眾多因素上進行競爭；店內和網上購物體驗和服務；聲譽和商店位置。我們與本地、區域、國家和國際百貨公司、專賣店、折扣店、折扣店、倉儲店和直銷店以及其他銷售我們在商店、網上或透過其他媒體或通路銷售的服裝、家居時裝和其他商品的零售商競爭。"},{"en":"As of January 31, 2026, we had approximately 377,000 Associates, many of whom worked less than 40 hours per week. Approximately 86% of these Associates worked in our retail stores. We hire thousands of temporary employees each year, particularly during the peak back-to-school and holiday seasons. We offer positions at a variety of levels in our stores, distribution and fulfillment centers, and offices, as well as many opportunities for Associates to grow and advance. Many Associates in our distribution network in the United States and Canada are covered by collective bargaining agreements, and other Associates are members of works councils in Europe. Our large, global workforce supports the execution of our flexible business model, including the timing and frequency of store deliveries and the management of a rapidly changing mix of merchandise in over 5,200 retail stores globally and ac","zh":"截至 2026 年 1 月 31 日，我們約有 377,000 名員工，其中許多人每週工作時間不到 40 小時。這些員工中大約 86% 在我們的零售店工作。我們每年僱用數千名臨時員工，特別是在返校高峰期和假期期間。我們在商店、配送和履行中心以及辦公室提供各種級別的職位，並為員工提供許多成長和進步的機會。我們在美國和加拿大的分銷網路中的許多員工都受到集體談判協議的保護，其他員工是歐洲勞資委員會的成員。我們龐大的全球員工隊伍支持我們靈活的業務模式的執行，包括商店送貨的時間和頻率以及對全球 5,200 多家零售商店快速變化的商品組合的管理和管理。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Marmaxx","val":36585000000,"zh":"Marmaxx"},{"name":"Home Goods","val":10172000000,"zh":"家居用品"},{"name":"TJX International","val":7986000000,"zh":"TJX國際"},{"name":"Tjx Canada","val":5629000000,"zh":"Tjx Canada"}],"total":60372000000}},"peers":["ROST","DLTR","DG","KSS","ULTA"]}}